    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "游击战，是由小规模部队针对敌方正规军展开的游动作战。属于不正规战的一种，以神出鬼没为要义。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 135,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "一般会采用<R=伏击,アンブッシュ>、奇袭等机动战术。除此之外，也包括在敌后破坏重要设施或战略目标等扰乱行动。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=伏击,アンブッシュ>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 155,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE;RUBY_LOCALIZED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "简直就是越南战争本身。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 33,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "对。面对装备了强力现代武器的美军，越共凭借游击战术进行了激烈抵抗。美军负伤人数超过28万，美国最终被迫从越南撤军。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 167,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "在冷战时代，可能引发核交锋的正规军大规模冲突很少见。从某种意义上说，游击战正逐渐成为战争的主流。今后其重要性还会继续提升。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 183,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "……那么，这样怎么样？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 33,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "给你个及格分吧。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 24,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "那可真谢谢了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 21,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "不过，还真讽刺。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 24,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "讽刺？什么？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 18,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "是历史。饱受游击战困扰的美国自己，在独立战争时也曾靠<R=民兵,ミニットマン>的游击战术把英军耍得团团转。要是没有游击战，当时能不能赢得独立都难说。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=民兵,ミニットマン>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 212,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE;RUBY_PRESERVED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "因果循环吗……要是可以，我倒真想离这种东西远点。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 72,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 12,
      "cn_text": "……。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 9,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 13,
      "cn_text": "怎、怎么了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 18,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 14,
      "cn_text": "Kaz……你要记住。命运不是用来接受的，而是要靠自己开辟。老把因果挂在嘴边，等你反应过来时，早就被它缠住了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 156,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 15,
      "cn_text": "……也是。我会注意的。",
